---------- Title ---------- */\n  .main-title{\n    text-align:center;\n    margin:22px 0 6px 0;\n    color:var(--pink-bright);\n    font-weight:800;\n  }\n  .main-title .num{ font-size:40px; }\n  .main-title .txt{ font-size:30px; }\n\n  /* ---------- Items ---------- */\n  .item{\n    border:1.5px solid var(--pink-bright);\n    border-radius:6px;\n    margin-top:20px;\n    padding:16px 18px;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:flex-start;\n    gap:16px;\n  }\n  .item-label{\n    flex:0 0 62px;\n    text-align:center;\n    color:var(--pink-bright);\n  }\n  .item-label .idx{\n    font-size:26px;\n    font-weight:800;\n    letter-spacing:1px;\n    line-height:1.1;\n  }\n  .item-label .cat{\n    font-size:13px;\n    font-weight:700;\n    margin-top:4px;\n    letter-spacing:0.5px;\n  }\n  .item-body{\n    flex:1 1 auto;\n    font-size:14.5px;\n    line-height:1.85;\n    color:#111;\n    text-align:justify;\n  }\n  .hl{ color:var(--pink-bright); }\n\n  /* ---------- Footer ---------- */\n  .footer{\n    text-align:center;\n    margin-top:26px;\n    color:var(--pink-bright);\n  }\n  .footer .line1{\n    font-size:11px;\n    font-weight:700;\n    letter-spacing:0.5px;\n  }\n  .footer .line2{\n    font-size:8.5px;\n    margin-top:6px;\n    letter-spacing:0.3px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"card\">\n\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <div class=\"brand\">\n        <div class=\"name\">LEADING MEDIA</div>\n        <div class=\"sub\">@ 领潮传媒</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"header-right\">\n        <div class=\"year-row\">\n          <span class=\"arrow\"></span>\n          <span class=\"year\">2023</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tagline\">品牌 X 营销 X 战略</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"main-title\">\n      <span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"txt\">大消费趋势</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"item-label\">\n        <div class=\"idx\">01</div>\n        <div class=\"cat\">健康养生</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"item-body\">\n        经济水平提高不仅改善了女性的生活条件，还有生活追求，加上职场加班让女性<span class=\"hl\">更加注重养生和健康</span>，少油少糖成了女性饮食的新习惯，<br>\n        低脂类、滋补类、养生零食类等是女性所关注的热销产品。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"item-label\">\n        <div class=\"idx\">02</div>\n        <div class=\"cat\">精致美学</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"item-body\">\n        即使在经济下行时期，<span class=\"hl\">美妆个护赛道也是增长趋势</span>，美容仪＋新型市场本土＋跨境电商等高速增长，主要用户群体在一二线用户，Z 世代人群为主<br>\n        口腔护理、医美、功能性护肤、香水香氛等赛道高速增长。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"item-label\">\n        <div class=\"idx\">03</div>\n        <div class=\"cat\">运动旅行</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"item-body\">\n        埃森哲调研显示 <span class=\"hl\">35% 的女性有长期健身的习惯</span>，这些女性会把近 1/3 的支出花在健身等方面，增加趣味性智能设备就尤为受欢迎<br>\n        <span class=\"hl\">在旅行赛道，“她”旅行增速明显</span>，体现在“四高”，高消费、高品质、高话语权、高性价比。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <div class=\"line1\">品牌策略｜IP 打造｜自媒体运营｜媒介推广｜达人矩阵</div>\n      <div class=\"line2\">领潮传媒 @LEADING MEDIA｜全渠公内容策略咨询</div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
